  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vcard\" style=\"width: 22em\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" class=\"n\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 125%\"><span class=\"fn\">Rayleen Malakar</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e6/Rayleen_Malakar_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20170507215112\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e6/Rayleen_Malakar_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20170507215112\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"322\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Rayleen Malakar Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Rayleen_Malakar_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:110%;\"><hr /><div style=\"background:lavender;\"><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">57th</a>&#160;President of the United States</div>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:none; text-align:center;\"><b>In&#160;office</b><br />January 20, 2089&#160;&#8211;&#160;January 20, 2093\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Vice&#160;President\n</th>\n<td>Caroline Shelby\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Preceded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Oscar_Lachman\" title=\"Oscar Lachman\">Oscar Lachman</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Succeeded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Seras_Stultz\" title=\"Seras Stultz\">Seras Stultz</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Born\n</th>\n<td>April 1, 2035<br />California\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Died\n</th>\n<td>2144<br />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Nationality\n</th>\n<td>American\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th>Political&#160;party\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Horizon_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Horizon Party (United States)\">Horizon</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Profession\n</th>\n<td>Civil Servant<br />Politician\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Religion\n</th>\n<td>Hinduism\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Rayleen Malakar</b> (April 1, 2035 – 2144) was an American politician who was the 57th President of the United States from 2089 to 2093 and the 87th United States Secretary of State from 2085 to 2089. A member of the Horizon Party, she was previously a Senator, and Director of Central Intelligence.\n</p><p>In 2088, Malakar ran a successful campaign to succeed Lachman as President, winning a comfortable 55% of the popular vote. Foreign policy drove the Malakar presidency, as the Central American annexation crisis began just three weeks into her Presidency; an event that would ultimately lead to the <a href=\"/wiki/Second_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Second Mexican-American War\">Second Mexican-American War</a> 1 year later. Domestically, Malakar presided over a weak recovery from the <a href=\"/wiki/Second_Depression\" title=\"Second Depression\">Second Depression</a>, along with continuing budget deficits and the perceived defeat in the Second Mexican War, she lost the 2092 presidential election to Liberal <a href=\"/wiki/Seras_Stultz\" title=\"Seras Stultz\">Seras Stultz</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Presidency\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Presidency</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Foreign_Policy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Foreign Policy</b></span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Central_America\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Central America</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Second_Mexican_War\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Second Mexican War</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Mediterranean_Union\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Mediterranean Union</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Economy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Economy</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Recession_of_2092-93\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Recession of 2092-93</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Presidency\">Presidency</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRayleen_Malakar%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foreign_Policy\"><b>Foreign Policy</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRayleen_Malakar%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Central_America\"><b>Central Ameri